# The site's pictures (web/about): the blob in its states, still and as short loops, the drawer
# closed (the whole room); then each page's drawer, for the manual. MIDI holds the notes (no key
# touched: the drawer slides away), a program change starts each state from a preset (MONDAY).
wait 4000
# IDLE: the top of the page, nothing played yet, the rain
shot idle.png
film 16 120 idle
# STONED: the filter shut
midi c0 00 00
tap EDIT
spin K1 -60
midi 90 30 64
wait 3500
expect panel 0
shot stoned.png
film 12 80 stoned
midi 80 30 00
wait 800
# LASERS: resonance to the top
midi c0 00 00
tap EDIT
spin K2 90
midi 90 30 64
wait 3500
shot lasers.png
film 12 80 lasers
midi 80 30 00
wait 800
# CRYING: the delay, one tear an echo, the puddle filling
midi c0 00 00
tap FX
spin K2 70
spin K4 50
midi 90 30 64
wait 600
midi 80 30 00
midi 90 33 64
wait 600
midi 80 33 00
midi 90 37 64
wait 2500
shot cry.png
film 16 80 cry
midi 80 37 00
wait 1500
# THE VOID: the room past its walls
midi c0 00 00
tap SEL
spin K1 60
spin K2 100
midi 90 30 64
wait 3500
shot void.png
film 12 100 void
midi 80 30 00
wait 1500
# FIRE: clipping (this is fine): all of it up, a big low chord
midi c0 1a 00
wait 300
tap GLO
spin K1 100
master 4096
midi b0 07 7f
midi b0 66 37
midi b0 67 7f
midi b0 66 03
midi b0 67 7f
midi 90 24 7f
midi 90 30 7f
midi 90 33 7f
midi 90 37 7f
midi 90 3c 7f
midi 90 3f 7f
wait 3500
shot fire.png
film 12 80 fire
midi 80 24 00
midi 80 30 00
midi 80 33 00
midi 80 37 00
midi 80 3c 00
midi 80 3f 00
master 2600
midi c0 00 00
wait 3500
# ASLEEP; much later, it looks at you
wait 30000
shot asleep.png
film 12 150 asleep
wait 70000
shot stare.png
film 12 150 stare
# THE PAGES, for the manual: each drawer, a note riding it
midi c0 00 00
wait 300
midi 90 30 64
tap HOME
wait 1500
shot page_body.png
tap EDIT
wait 1500
shot page_eyes.png
tap ENV
wait 1500
shot page_mouth.png
tap LFO
wait 1500
shot page_vibe.png
tap FX
wait 1500
shot page_tears.png
tap SEL
wait 1500
shot page_walls.png
tap GLO
wait 1500
shot page_mixer.png
tap ARP
wait 400
tap ARP
wait 400
tap HOME
wait 1000
tap HOME
wait 400
expect page 11
shot page_shadow.png
tap ENV
wait 1000
tap ENV
wait 400
expect page 12
shot page_sigh.png
tap LFO
wait 1000
tap LFO
wait 400
expect page 13
shot page_tremble.png
midi 80 30 00
tap SEQ
wait 1000
tap SEQ
tap PLAY
wait 1500
expect page 6
shot page_deck.png
tap PLAY
wait 300
